   "source": [
    "# Lambda Functions\n",
    "\n",
    "- A lambda function in Python is a small anonymous function (a function without a name).\n",
    "It is written in one line and used for short, simple operations.\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
